        6,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/sweet-home-texas-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Once home to 350 residents, a dozen stores, and a recreation hall, Sweet Home now hosts fewer than 50 people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/sweet-home-texas-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Providence Missionary Baptist Church stays active, and annual homecomings keep Sweet Home’s community spirit alive amid abandoned buildings.",
